  "question": {
    "text": "The period of revolution of planet <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> around the sun is eight times that of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>. How many times is the distance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> from the sun, greater than that of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "As <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8733;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>,<br /><br />so, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>3</mn></msubsup></mfrac></math><br /><br />or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></math><br /><br />so,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msub></math>"
  }
